cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or study CGMP, please cite CGMP Project and the relevant release."
title: "Cost-Grounded Mobility Pricing (CGMP)"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "CGMP Project"
version: "1.4-preprint"
date-released: "2026-09-21"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gihan-kanishka/cgmp"
url: "https://github.com/gihan-kanishka/cgmp"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  An open ride-hailing fare and dispatch framework with published class rates,
  explicit passenger-trip time compensation, paid pickup distance, deterministic
  progressive search, passenger-cancellation pickup settlement, paused billing
  for driver personal stops, progressive long-distance displacement accrual after
  40 passenger kilometres, and a cash-commission ledger with a settlement threshold.
keywords:
  - ride-hailing
  - mobility pricing
  - transport economics
  - progressive search
  - driver compensation
  - long-distance displacement
  - digital taxi meter
  - market design
